      "description": "Chronology keeps day, date, activity and current chapter together, including rest and unknown locations.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-chapters\" aria-label=\"Journey chapters\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-chapter\" aria-current=\"step\"><span class=\"ds-day\">02</span><span><small>4 November / Rest day</small><strong>A day to pause</strong></span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-chapter\"><span class=\"ds-day\">03</span><span><small>5 November / Location not recorded</small><strong>Continue the journey</strong></span></button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-chapters{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}.ds-chapter{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:16px;padding:16px;min-height:72px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:6px;text-align:left;background:transparent;color:var(--foreground,#172D3B);font:400 16px/1.5 var(--kairn-typography-family-interface,\"Instrument Sans\"),sans-serif;cursor:pointer}.ds-chapter[aria-current]{background:var(--selected,#E0EDF5);border-color:var(--primary,#164D70)}.ds-day{font:500 30px/1.2 var(--kairn-typography-family-editorial,Newsreader),serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--primary,#164D70)}.ds-chapter small{display:block;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted-foreground,#405969)}.ds-chapter strong{display:block;line-height:1.4}.ds-chapter:hover{background:var(--selected,#E0EDF5)}.ds-chapter:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--ring,#164D70);outline-offset:2px}.ds-chapter:active{opacity:.78}"
    },
